OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1789404970
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAKey convicted Palestine Action
OL,4,Amember on the run
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis trial began this summer in his
OL,7,Fabsence and last month the jury
OL,8,Fconvicted him of criminal damage by a
OL,9,Fmajority of nine-to-one.
OL,11,FProsecutors told the court Middlebrough
OL,12,Fhad helped to plan and organise the
OL,13,FAugust 2024 break-in at Elbit Systems
OL,14,Fin Bristol, a British defence firm with
OL,15,Fan Israeli parent company. The break-in
OL,16,Fhappened 10 months before the
OL,17,Fgovernment banned the group under
OL,18,Fcounter-terrorism powers.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
